# hero-hover (h11-hero): the pointer at the hero's centre (about (940, 450)),
# settled by a 1 px nudge; the cursor line pointer; the still hero.
route welcome
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
move 940 450
move 941 450
wait 300
shot hero-hover
